{"seq":307,"slug":"supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality","title":"供应商绩效记分卡与协同治理：OTIF 准时交付、质量、响应与合规评分、分级管理与改进闭环","stage":"DONE","category":"global-ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 供应商绩效记分卡与协同治理：OTIF、质量、评分、分级与改进闭环 简介\n\n「这家供应商靠不靠谱」在采购嘴里常是一句模糊的经验判断，但当这句话要决定下一周期的订单份额、账期、返点与罚金时，它就必须变成一组分子分母写死、可复算、可申诉、且能追溯到原始单据的数字。供应商绩效记分卡讲的就是如何把这句经验判断工程化：从最上游的 KPI 定义，到把散落在多主体系统里的事实接成可信数据，到评分驱动的分级与份额，再到偏差的改进闭环与防舞弊审计。\n\n它值得单独立篇，是因为记分卡处在供应链事实与采购决策的交界点上。上游，跨境链路把一次交付的事实打散在供应商、货代、口岸、海外仓与末端派送各自的系统里；下游，分数又直接对应真金白银的经济后果。任何一处定义含糊、数据错配、评分被操纵，都会以错误扣款、错误降级或不公平份额的形式显形——而且往往在供应商申诉或外部审计时才被发现。\n\n本 hub 用四章沿「定义 → 数据 → 决策 → 治理」递进。\n\n第一章「供应商 KPI 体系与 OTIF/质量模型」是定义底座：交付/质量/响应/成本/合规五类 KPI 怎么拆，准时足量（OTIF）这个复合指标怎么判定，来料质量怎么用合格率、DPPM 与 Pareto 量化。\n\n第二章「记分卡数据采集、归因与口径归一」解决可信度：事件如何采集并按 PO/ASN/收货主键对齐，延误与缺陷在多主体间如何归因，单位与币种怎么归一，以及漏采错配如何检测、评分如何暂挂、供应商申诉如何复核。\n\n第三章「分级管理、分层与激励/约束计划」让分数产生后果：绩效分级与战略分层如何区分，返点、账期、份额、罚金如何挂钩，绩效乘子在产能、双源与集中度约束下如何经平滑变成可执行的配额。\n\n第四章「改进闭环、审计与合规协同运营」守住闭环与底线：CAPA/SCAR 改进工单如何把 C 级真正推回 B 级，评审会如何治理绩效沟通，以及职责分离、不可篡改留痕与反商业贿赂如何保证整套体系诚实运转。\n\n四章是一条强依赖链：定义不清，数据无从算起；数据不可信，分级就是错配；分级不落地，评分没有后果；治理缺位，前三步都可能被操纵。\n\n边界上需要说明：本 hub 处理的是对供应商的**绩效评估与协同治理**，不展开采购寻源与合同执行本身（那属于采购协同与供应商管理域），也不重复仓库内部的来料收货操作；质量事件的工程处置（SCAR/8D 闭环）在第四章与「供应商质量事件」相邻主题衔接，但本 hub 站在记分卡如何消费这些事件的视角。\n\n阅读路径：采购与供应链运营按 1→2→3→4 顺序读即可建立全貌；数据工程重点读第二章；合规与内审可先读第四章再回看第二、三章的控制点。具备基础的供应链运营或数据建模概念即可，文中会就地补足 SCOR、EDI/EPCIS、AQL 等背景。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supplier-kpi-otif-quality-model","title":"供应商 KPI 体系与 OTIF/质量模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/supplier-kpi-otif-quality-model","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supplier-kpi-taxonomy-definition","title":"供应商绩效 KPI 分类与 OTIF/OTD/质量/响应指标定义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/supplier-kpi-otif-quality-model/supplier-kpi-taxonomy-definition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"otif-on-time-in-full-judgment","title":"OTIF 准时足量判定与度量窗口建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/supplier-kpi-otif-quality-model/otif-on-time-in-full-judgment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-defect-kpi-dppm-pareto","title":"来料质量缺陷量化：批次合格率、DPPM 与缺陷 Pareto","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/supplier-kpi-otif-quality-model/quality-defect-kpi-dppm-pareto"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"scorecard-data-attribution-normalization","title":"记分卡数据采集、归因与口径归一","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/scorecard-data-attribution-normalization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scorecard-data-source-pipeline","title":"记分卡数据源与采集管道：事件流与单据主键对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/scorecard-data-attribution-normalization/scorecard-data-source-pipeline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"metric-attribution-normalization","title":"指标归因、责任分摊与跨单位/币种口径归一","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/scorecard-data-attribution-normalization/metric-attribution-normalization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-quality-anomaly-dispute-recheck","title":"数据质量异常、漏采错采与评分申诉复核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/scorecard-data-attribution-normalization/data-quality-anomaly-dispute-recheck"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"tiering-segmentation-incentive-program","title":"分级管理、分层与激励/约束计划","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/tiering-segmentation-incentive-program","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supplier-segmentation-tiering-model","title":"供应商分层与分级模型：阈值、升降级与动态分级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/tiering-segmentation-incentive-program/supplier-segmentation-tiering-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"incentive-penalty-program-design","title":"激励与约束计划设计：返点、份额倾斜、账期与罚金","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/tiering-segmentation-incentive-program/incentive-penalty-program-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"allocation-preference-dynamic-quota","title":"评分驱动的份额分配与动态配额执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/tiering-segmentation-incentive-program/allocation-preference-dynamic-quota"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"improvement-audit-compliance-collab-ops","title":"改进闭环、审计与合规协同运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/improvement-audit-compliance-collab-ops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"improvement-plan-capa-closed-loop","title":"记分卡触发的改进计划与复评闭环状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/improvement-audit-compliance-collab-ops/improvement-plan-capa-closed-loop"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scorecard-review-governance-communication","title":"供应商评审会、绩效沟通与治理运营","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/improvement-audit-compliance-collab-ops/scorecard-review-governance-communication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"audit-compliance-anti-corruption","title":"绩效评分审计、内控合规与反商业贿赂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-vendor-performance-scorecard-otif-quality/improvement-audit-compliance-collab-ops/audit-compliance-anti-corruption"}]}]}